# ---------------- Zombie.events (Task 16 Part A: random-angle wander) ----------------
# A shambling zombie: it picks a random direction, walks it for 20-60 ticks, picks another —
# no waypoint grid, so the movement never looks like a patrol route. Seeing the player takes
# it out of the wander and into a chase; losing sight sends it back to shambling.

when me appears
  enemy type "Zombie"
  set my mode to "patrol"
  wander speed 60

# A zombie that bumps into the player while wandering still bites.
when me is near player by 40
  me is wandering
  face nearest player

when me sees player by my SightDistance
  set my mode to "chase"
  face nearest player
  goto nearest player speed 100 facing forward

when every 0.2 seconds
  my mode is "chase"
  goto nearest player speed 100 facing forward

when me stops seeing player
  set my mode to "patrol"
  wander speed 60

# ---- taking a bullet (Task 16 Part C.5 damage, Part E effects) ----
# `TK_Bullet.events` sends `"damage"` with the weapon's number, so the zombie finally dies to
# gunfire: Blood at the body on the hit, Gibs on the death, then it leaves the scene.
when message "damage" arrives
  spawn Blood at me
  set my LastDmg to other's damage
  set my health to my health - my LastDmg

when my health becomes 0
  spawn Gib at me offset 0
  spawn Gib at me offset 12
  spawn Gib at me offset -12
  print "TK4: zombie death — gibs"
  destroy me
